id=hfr
name=Adaptive refresh rate
author=salvogiangri
description=Adaptive refresh rate props (touch/idle timers that outlast the longest delay choice), Adaptive held at 60 Hz from a user-selectable 1-3 s (default 2 s, Settings > Display > Adaptive smoothness delay, persist.sys.k4.adaptive_idle_ms) after the last touch (K4AdaptiveTouch), High (locked 120 Hz, 120 fps) motion smoothness option, stale peak_refresh_rate/min_refresh_rate settings below the panel minimum ignored.
